Write your verdict as your final message (the sandbox may not let you write files): first line SAFE TO INSTALL / SAFE AFTER FIXES / DO NOT INSTALL; numbered findings with file:line, the evidence and the exact fix; what is right; what you could not verify. At most 40 lines.
No GPU, no ssh, no git, no network, no deletion commands; do not read or write /home or /data*.
